@startuml WeClawBotNotify_RegisterSequence

title WeClawBotNotify V1 - 用户注册与初始化序列图\n(双令牌认证)

== 第一部分：用户注册账号 ==

actor "用户" as User
participant "Web 管理后台\n(浏览器)" as Web
participant "server/HTTPServer" as API
participant "auth/AccountService" as AccountSvc
participant "jwtx/JWTHelper" as JWTHelper
participant "model/RefreshTokenModel" as RTModel
participant "SQLite" as DB

User -> Web : 打开注册页面
activate Web

Web -> API : POST /api/auth/register\n{ username, password }
activate API

API -> AccountSvc : register(username, password)
activate AccountSvc

AccountSvc -> AccountSvc : hashPassword(password)

AccountSvc -> DB : INSERT INTO users\n(username, password_hash)\nVALUES (?, ?)
activate DB
DB --> AccountSvc : userId
deactivate DB

AccountSvc -> JWTHelper : generateAccessToken(\n  JWTClaims{UID, TokenType=access, JTI}\n)
activate JWTHelper
JWTHelper --> AccountSvc : accessToken (短有效期)
deactivate JWTHelper

AccountSvc -> JWTHelper : generateRefreshToken(\n  JWTClaims{UID, TokenType=refresh, JTI}\n)
activate JWTHelper
JWTHelper --> AccountSvc : refreshToken (长有效期)
deactivate JWTHelper

AccountSvc -> RTModel : insert(ctx, &RefreshToken{\n  userId, jti, revoked=0, expiresAt\n})
activate RTModel
RTModel -> DB : INSERT INTO refresh_tokens\n(user_id, jti, revoked, expires_at)\nVALUES (?, ?, 0, ?)
activate DB
DB --> RTModel : OK
deactivate DB
RTModel --> AccountSvc : nil
deactivate RTModel

AccountSvc --> API : TokenPair { accessToken, refreshToken }
deactivate AccountSvc

API --> Web : 200 OK\n{\n  token: accessToken,\n  refreshToken: refreshToken,\n  user: { id, username }\n}
deactivate API

Web -> Web : 存储 accessToken\n和 refreshToken\n到 localStorage

Web --> User : 注册成功，自动登录\n跳转到 Dashboard
deactivate Web

== 第二部分：创建 Client (绑定微信Bot) ==

User -> Web : 点击"创建 Client"\n输入名称 "我的微信"
activate Web

Web -> API : POST /api/client/create\n{ name: "我的微信" }\nAuthorization: Bearer {accessToken}
activate API

API -> API : ClientAuth 验证 Access Token → userId

participant "client/ClientService" as ClientSvc
participant "ilink/WeixinMonitor" as Monitor
participant "ilink/WeixinApiClient" as Client
participant "ilink/WeixinAuth" as Auth
participant "微信 iLink 服务器" as WeChat

API -> ClientSvc : createClient(userId, "我的微信")
activate ClientSvc

ClientSvc -> Auth : fetchQRCode(botType: "3")
activate Auth
Auth -> WeChat : GET /ilink/bot/get_bot_qrcode?bot_type=3
WeChat --> Auth : { qrcode, qrcode_img_content }
Auth --> ClientSvc : QRCodeResult
deactivate Auth

ClientSvc -> DB : INSERT INTO clients\n(user_id, name, status: "pending")
activate DB
DB --> ClientSvc : clientId
deactivate DB

ClientSvc --> API : ClientQRResult { qrcodeUrl, clientId }
deactivate ClientSvc

API --> Web : { qrcodeUrl, clientId }
deactivate API

Web --> User : 展示二维码\n"请用微信扫码"
deactivate Web

User -> WeChat : 微信扫描二维码确认

loop 前端轮询状态
  Web -> API : GET /api/client/status?clientId=xxx\nAuthorization: Bearer {accessToken}
  API -> ClientSvc : pollClientStatus(userId, clientId)
  ClientSvc -> Auth : pollQRStatus(sessionKey)
  Auth -> WeChat : GET /ilink/bot/get_qrcode_status
  WeChat --> Auth : { status }
  Auth --> ClientSvc : { status }
  ClientSvc --> API : ClientStatus
  API --> Web : { status }
end

WeChat --> Auth : { status: "confirmed", bot_token, ilink_user_id }

API -> DB : UPDATE clients\nSET ilink_user_id = ?,\n    status = "bound"\nWHERE id = ?

API -> API : 启动 WeixinMonitor

Web --> User : ✅ Client 创建成功\n微信Bot已绑定

== 第三部分：创建 Application (生成推送Token) ==

User -> Web : 点击"创建 Application"\n输入名称 "Jenkins CI"
activate Web

participant "application/ApplicationService" as AppSvc

Web -> API : POST /api/application\n{ name: "Jenkins CI", description: "..." }\nAuthorization: Bearer {accessToken}
activate API

API -> API : ClientAuth 验证 Access Token → userId

API -> AppSvc : createApplication(userId, "Jenkins CI", "...")
activate AppSvc

AppSvc -> AppSvc : generateAppToken()\n生成随机 Token (如 app_xxx...)

AppSvc -> DB : INSERT INTO applications\n(user_id, token, name, description)\nVALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)
activate DB
DB --> AppSvc : appId
deactivate DB

AppSvc --> API : Application { id, token (明文仅此一次), name }
note right
  Token 明文仅在创建时返回一次
  之后只存储 hash
  用户必须妥善保存
end note
deactivate AppSvc

API --> Web : 200 OK\n{ id, token: "app_xxx...", name, createdAt }
deactivate API

Web --> User : ✅ Application 创建成功\n⚠️ 请立即复制 Token\nToken 仅显示一次！
deactivate Web

note over User, WeChat
  初始化完成：
  1. 用户账号已注册 (双令牌已签发)
  2. Client 已创建 (微信Bot已绑定)
  3. Application 已创建 (推送Token已生成)
  ===
  外部系统可使用 appToken
  调用 POST /api/message 推送通知
  通知通过 Client 推送到用户微信
  ===
  双令牌机制：
  - accessToken 短有效期，用于日常请求
  - refreshToken 长有效期，用于刷新accessToken
  - 前端自动处理令牌刷新
end note

@enduml
